  "totalBlocks": 55,
  "translatedBlocks": 42,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b65d29436b874ec",
      "translationZh": "2025 年 9 月更新：我们不再提供 HUGS 模型部署容器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a4b4513287eb01d9",
      "translationZh": "要在您的基础设施中轻松部署经过优化的 Hugging Face 模型，请查看 Dell Enterprise Hub 和 Azure AI Foundry 中的 Hugging Face Collection。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c5597002014b03bb",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们非常高兴地宣布推出 Hugging Face Generative AI Services，简称 HUGS：这是一套经过优化、零配置的推理微服务，旨在简化并加速使用开放模型开发 AI 应用的过程。HUGS 基于 Text Generation Inference 和 Transformers 等开源 Hugging Face 技术构建，为您在自己的基础设施中高效构建和扩展生成式 AI 应用提供最佳解决方案。HUGS 经过优化，可在多种硬件加速器上运行开放模型，包括 NVIDIA GPUs、AMD GPUs，以及即将支持的 AWS Inferentia 和 Google TPUs。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "cc8b7e71b6a115a3",
      "translationZh": "面向开放模型的零配置优化推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f5e51eb7fcd9cbf",
      "translationZh": "HUGS 简化了在您自己的基础设施和多种硬件上对开放模型进行优化部署的过程。开发者和组织面临的一个关键挑战，是针对特定 GPU 或 AI 加速器优化 LLM 推理工作负载时的工程复杂性。借助 HUGS，我们能够为最受欢迎的开放 LLM 实现最大吞吐量部署，而无须任何配置。HUGS 提供的每一种部署配置都经过全面测试并持续维护，确保开箱即用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b269d364bb21cbf",
      "translationZh": "HUGS 模型部署提供与 OpenAI 兼容的 API，可直接替换现有生成式 AI 应用所依赖的模型提供商 API。只需将您的代码指向 HUGS 部署，即可使用托管在您自己基础设施中的开放模型来驱动应用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1721e34bbece2b1b",
      "translationZh": "为什么选择 HUGS？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1b50567480697f72",
      "translationZh": "HUGS 提供了一种简单的方式，让您能够使用托管在自己基础设施中的开放模型构建 AI 应用，并具备以下优势：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7c491bb01dfbe1bd",
      "translationZh": "在您自己的基础设施中：在您自己的安全环境内部署开放模型。让您的数据和模型远离互联网！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "19b12e99e051c57f",
      "translationZh": "零配置部署：HUGS 通过零配置设置，将部署时间从数周缩短至数分钟，并针对您的 NVIDIA、AMD GPU 或 AI 加速器，自动优化模型和服务配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4f11a1aec83af856",
      "translationZh": "针对硬件优化的推理：HUGS 基于 Hugging Face 的 Text Generation Inference (TGI) 构建，经过优化，可在不同硬件配置下实现峰值性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "63978bb6e5f48db8",
      "translationZh": "硬件灵活性：可在多种加速器上运行 HUGS，包括 NVIDIA GPUs、AMD GPUs，并且即将支持 AWS Inferentia 和 Google TPUs。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b75ef70a1ec4db84",
      "translationZh": "模型灵活性：HUGS 兼容多种开源模型，确保您的 AI 应用拥有灵活性和选择空间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a237508c11814831",
      "translationZh": "行业标准 API：使用 Kubernetes 轻松部署 HUGS，其端点与 OpenAI API 兼容，可最大限度减少代码改动。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f0a00465440325f5",
      "translationZh": "企业级发行版：HUGS 是 Hugging Face 开源技术的企业级发行版，提供长期支持、严格测试和 SOC2 合规性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0003bd06f246dc62",
      "translationZh": "企业合规：通过包含必要的许可证和服务条款，最大限度降低合规风险。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43700c3071cbf441",
      "translationZh": "我们向部分 Enterprise Hub 客户提供了 HUGS 的早期访问权限：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5cb8592f4e74e418",
      "translationZh": "HUGS 能在本地部署性能良好、开箱即用的模型，大幅节省时间——在使用 HUGS 之前，我们需要一周时间，现在不到 1 小时就能完成。对于有主权 AI 要求的客户来说，这是一项颠覆性的改变！——Henri Jouhaud，Polyconseil 首席技术官",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6cd69fd4a01f092f",
      "translationZh": "我们尝试使用 HUGS，在 GCP 上用 L4 GPU 部署 Gemma 2——我们无需折腾库、版本和参数，开箱即用。HUGS 让我们有信心扩大开放模型在内部的使用规模！——Ghislain Putois，Orange 研究工程师",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3a6dd514061baa6b",
      "translationZh": "工作原理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5d32927274a6826",
      "translationZh": "使用 HUGS 很简单。你可以这样开始：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aee55199bedfbeae",
      "translationZh": "注意：根据所选的部署方式，你需要拥有相应订阅或云市场产品的访问权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "cc4fa7f16e5baba9",
      "translationZh": "从哪里获取 HUGS",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "391a054bb5c0c5fe",
      "translationZh": "HUGS 可通过多个渠道获取：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ec18c0f7b4c19854",
      "translationZh": "云服务提供商（CSP）市场：你可以在 Amazon Web Services (AWS) 和 Google Cloud Platform (GCP) 上查找并部署 HUGS。Microsoft Azure 支持即将推出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d66485526a330a7f",
      "translationZh": "DigitalOcean：HUGS 已原生集成到 DigitalOcean，作为一项新的 1-Click Models 服务提供，由 Hugging Face HUGS 和 GPU Droplets 提供支持。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0eaa69c960b9f827",
      "translationZh": "Enterprise Hub：如果你的组织已升级到 Enterprise Hub，请联系我们的销售团队以获取 HUGS 的访问权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0289b1e5f0ec8b8f",
      "translationZh": "有关每个平台的具体部署说明，请参阅上方链接的相关文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "dfe95783edfef791",
      "translationZh": "定价",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78c95adc793ae0d9",
      "translationZh": "除 DigitalOcean 上的部署外，HUGS 根据每个容器的运行时间提供按需定价。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a709cfeeb3422a36",
      "translationZh": "AWS Marketplace 和 Google Cloud Platform Marketplace：每个容器每小时 $1，无最低费用（计算用量由 CSP 另行计费）。在 AWS 上，你有 5 day free trial period，可以免费测试 HUGS。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "87dbe565a46e15e5",
      "translationZh": "DigitalOcean：由 Hugging Face HUGS 提供支持的 1-Click Models 在 DigitalOcean 上无需额外费用即可使用，常规 GPU Droplets 计算费用适用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cc28dfb08fb8c953",
      "translationZh": "Enterprise Hub：我们为 Enterprise Hub 组织提供定制的 HUGS 访问服务。请联系我们的销售团队以了解更多信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b96e059f4692f60a",
      "translationZh": "运行推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "98d5ff7f4b269bb2",
      "translationZh": "HUGS 基于 Text Generation Inference (TGI)，提供流畅的推理体验。有关详细说明和示例，请参阅《在 HUGS 上运行推理》指南。HUGS 使用与 OpenAI 兼容的 Messages API，让你可以使用熟悉的工具和库发送请求，例如 cURL、huggingface_hub SDK 和 openai SDK。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "22a6bb2a1e9303e4",
      "translationZh": "支持的模型和硬件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "298236de1323a979",
      "translationZh": "HUGS 支持的开放模型和硬件平台生态系统正在不断壮大。请参阅我们的“支持的模型”和“支持的硬件”页面，获取最新信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "574c9867d216eb12",
      "translationZh": "我们今天发布时支持 13 个热门的开放大语言模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "06bf5ba53d5663bd",
      "translationZh": "如需详细了解支持的模型与硬件组合，请查阅文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "052a2329efff4b6c",
      "translationZh": "今天就开始使用 HUGS",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b2c353489f21ce4",
      "translationZh": "HUGS 让你能够轻松利用开放模型的强大能力，在自己的基础设施中实现零配置的优化推理。借助 HUGS，你可以掌控自己的 AI 应用，并轻松将使用封闭模型构建的概念验证应用迁移到由你自行托管的开放模型上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3301c1e594039847",
      "translationZh": "今天就开始行动，在 AWS、Google Cloud 或 DigitalOcean 上部署 HUGS！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
